r de Pro versie <a href='%s' target='_blank'><\/a><\/span>"],"License Key":["Licentiesleutel"],"Your license key provides access to updates and support":["Je licentiesleutel biedt toegang tot updates en ondersteuning"],"Your <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> license is %s":["Je <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> licentie is %s"],"<em>Already purchased? Simply enter your license key below to activate YouTube Feeds Pro.<\/em>":["<em>Al gekocht? Voer gewoon je licentiesleutel hieronder in om YouTube Feeds Pro te activeren.<\/em>"],"Enter License Key":["Voer licentiesleutel in"],"Manage License":["Beheer licentie"],"Enter API Key":["Voer API-sleutel in"],"Connected YouTube Account":["Verbonden YouTube account"],"This account is used to display channel feeds. It will not affect playlist, favorites, search, livestreams or single videos stream.":["Dit account wordt gebruikt om kanaal feeds te tonen. Het heeft geen invloed op afspeellijsten, favorieten, zoeken, livestreams of individuele videostreams."],"Feed not working? ":["Werkt de feed niet? "],"Try Re-authenticating connected account":["Probeer je verbonden account opnieuw te authenticeren"],"API Key":["API-sleutel"],"Preserve settings if plugin is removed":["Instellingen behouden als plugin wordt verwijderd"],"This will make sure that all of your feeds and settings are still saved even if the plugin is uninstalled":["Dit zal ervoor zorgen dat al je feeds en instellingen opgeslagen blijven, zelfs als de plugin verwijderd wordt"],"Import Feed Settings":["Importeer feed instellingen"],"You will need a JSON file previously exported from the Feeds for YouTube Plugin":["Je hebt een JSON bestand nodig dat eerder is ge\u00ebxporteerd vanuit de Feeds voor YouTube plugin"],"Export Feed Settings":["Exporteer feed instellingen"],"Select Feed":["Selecteer feed"],"Export":["Export"],"Export settings for one or more of your feeds":["Instellingen exporteren voor een of meer van je feeds"],"Custom Code":["Aangepaste code"],"Caching":["Caching"],"1:00":["1:00"],"2:00":["2:00"],"3:00":["3:00"],"4:00":["4:00"],"5:00":["5:00"],"6:00":["6:00"],"7:00":["7:00"],"8:00":["8:00"],"9:00":["9:00"],"10:00":["10:00"],"11:00":["11:00"],"12:00":["12:00"],"Cache cleared successfully.":["Cache succesvol gewist."],"Couldn't clear the cache.":["Kon de cache niet wissen."],"Clear All Caches":["Alle caches legen"],"Used for showing views. Example: 392k views":["Gebruikt om weergaven te tonen. Voorbeeld: 392k weergaven"],"Ago":["Geleden"],"Used for showing time. Example: 3d ago":["Gebruikt om tijd weer te geven. Voorbeeld: 3 dagen geleden"],"Used to highlight when a video is streaming live":["Gebruikt om aan te geven wanneer een video live wordt gestreamd"],"Used to highlight when a video is going to stream live":["Gebruikt om aan te geven wanneer een video live gaat streamen"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 3 minutes 21 seconds":["Gebruikt om de lengte van de video weer te geven. Voorbeeld: 3 minuten 21 seconden"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 1 hour 3 minutes":["Gebruikt om de lengte van de video weer te geven. Voorbeeld: 1 uur 3 minuten"],"To display the call to action":["Om de Call To Action te tonen"],"Thousands":["Duizenden"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 321K videos":["Gebruikt bij het aantal weergaven. Voorbeeld: 321K video's"],"Millions":["Miljoenen"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 4.2M videos":["Gebruikt bij het aantal weergaven. Voorbeeld: 4,2M video's"],"Custom Text\/Translate":["Aangepaste tekst\/vertaling"],"Enter custom text for the words below, or translate it into the language you would like to use.":["Voer aangepaste tekst in voor de onderstaande woorden of vertaal deze in de taal die je wil gebruiken."],"Original Text":["Originele tekst"],"Custom text\/translation":["Aangepaste tekst\/vertaling"],"Context":["Context"],"AJAX theme loading fix":["AJAX thema laden oplossing"],"Usage Tracking":["Gebruik bijhouden"],"Cron Clear Cache":["Cron cache wissen"],"If your YouTube feed is not updating, your WordPress installation may have a rare issue with clearing temporary data in your database. Enable this setting to use WordPress cron to clear your feed caches.":["Als je YouTube feed niet wordt ge\u00fcpdatet, kan je WordPress installatie mogelijk een zeldzaam probleem hebben met het wissen van tijdelijke gegevens in je database. Schakel deze instelling in om de WordPress cron te gebruiken om je feed caches te wissen."],"Enqueue JavaScript in header":["JavaScript in header laden"],"Add the JavaScript file for the plugin in the header instead of the footer":["Voeg het JavaScript bestand voor de plugin toe aan de header in plaats van de footer"],"Disable WP Posts":["Schakel WP berichten uit"],"This will disable the feature that saves each video as a WordPress post.":["Dit schakelt de functie uit die elke video als een WordPress bericht opslaat."],"Save new videos as":["Nieuwe video's opslaan als"],"Draft":["Concept"],"Publish":["Publiceer"],"When you import new videos, they will be saved accordingly":["Wanneer je nieuwe video's importeert, worden ze dienovereenkomstig opgeslagen"],"Information to Display":["Informatie om te tonen"],"Stats (Like and Comment Count)":["Statistieken (Aantal vind-ik-leuks en reactie telling)"],"Saved Featured Images":["Opgeslagen uitgelichte afbeeldingen"],"Enabling this feature will automatically download video thumbnails and assign them as the featured image for a video post created using YouTube Feeds. Image files are stored in your WordPress media library.":["Als je deze functie inschakelt, worden video thumbnails automatisch gedownload en toegewezen als de uitgelichte afbeelding voor een videobericht dat is gemaakt met YouTube Feeds. Afbeeldingsbestanden worden opgeslagen in je WordPress media-bibliotheek."],"Smash Balloon Team":["Smash Balloon team"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Bij Smash Balloon bouwen we software waarmee je in enkele minuten prachtige responsive sociale media feeds voor je site kan maken."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["We zijn op een missie om het supereenvoudig te maken om sociale media feeds toe te voegen in WordPress. Geen ingewikkelde installatiestappen meer, lelijke iFrame widgets, of negatieve pagina snelheid scores."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Onze plugins zijn niet alleen gemakkelijk te gebruiken, maar ook volledig aanpasbaar, betrouwbaar en snel! Daarom kiezen meer dan 1,6 miljoen geweldige gebruikers, net als je, ervoor om ze op hun site te gebruiken."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Onze andere plugins voor sociale media feeds"],"Plugins we recommend":["Plugins die we aanbevelen"],"Search Documentation":["Documentatie zoeken"],"Need more support? We\u2019re here to help.":["Meer ondersteuning nodig? We zijn er om je te helpen."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Dien een ondersteuning ticket in"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Ons snelle en vriendelijke ondersteuningsteam staat altijd klaar om te helpen!"],"System Info":["Systeem info"],"Collapse":["Samenvouwen"],"Expand":["Uitvouwen"],"Export Settings":["Export instellingen"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Deel je plugin instellingen eenvoudig met de ondersteuning"],"Getting Started":["Aan de slag"],"Some helpful resources to get you started":["Enkele nuttige hulpbronnen om je op weg te helpen"],"More help getting started":["Meer hulp over aan de slag"],"Docs & Troubleshooting":["Docs & probleemoplossing"],"Run into an issue? Check out our help docs.":["Een probleem tegengekomen? Bekijk onze help docs."],"View Documentation":["Bekijk documentatie"],"Additional Resources":["Aanvullende gegevensbronnen"],"To help you get the most out of the plugin":["Om je te helpen het meeste uit de plugin te halen"],"View Blog":["Bekijk blog"],"Creating Your First YouTube Feed":[""],"How do I Find a Channel ID?":[""],"Guide to Creating and Using an API Key":[""],"How do I Embed a Feed Into a Template Directly?":[""],"My Feed is Showing Unlisted Videos":[""],"Can I Change When the Video Plays?":[""],"How Does the Plugin Optimize Page Load Time?":[""],"Troubleshooting 'YouTube Data API has not been used in project'":[""],"Will Feeds For YouTube Work with Caching Plugins?":[""],"Enter or Paste API Key":[""],"Learn more about how to create and add an API Key here":[""],"Connect with an Access Token":[""],"Reviews":[""],"WPChat":[""],"Install WPChat and connect with customers on WhatsApp, Messenger, Telegram & Instagram and more":[""],"WPConsent":[""],"Detect all the plugins that use cookies and sets a consent banner in just a few clicks. Works well with Smash Balloon plugins.":[""],"TikTok":[""],"Convert videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Recheck license":[""],"Congratulations! You have upgraded to Youtube Feed ":[""],"Please update the plugin by clicking the button on the right for changes to take effect":[""],"Update Plugin":[""],"The plugin will be updated to a newer version":[""],"You might want to backup your website before updating the plugin":[""],"Update Anyway":[""],"Entered API Key is invalid. You can double check the API Key or learn more about generating them <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>here<\/a>":[""],"API Key is used to fetch from the YouTube API, and is required for several features to work. <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>Learn more<\/a>":[""],"No requests will be made to third-party websites. To accommodate this, some features of the plugin will be limited.":[""],"The plugin will function as normal and load videos directly from YouTube.":[""],"detected":[""],"No GDPR consent plugin detected. Install a compatible <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/feeds-for-youtube-gdpr-compliance\/?youtube' target='_blank'>GDPR consent plugin<\/a>, or manually enable the setting to display a GDPR compliant version of the feed to all visitors.":[""],"Activate WPConsent":[""],"Install WPConsent":[""],"Activate WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Install WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Manage cookie and privacy preference features from a single place. Smash Balloon plugins work great with WPConsent.":[""],"Installing...":[""],"This helps us prevent plugin and theme conflicts by sending a report in the background once per week about your settings and relevant site stats. It does not send sensitive information like access tokens, email addresses, or user info. This will not affect your site performance as well. <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-feed\/docs\/usage-tracking\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=usage-tracking' target='_blank'>Learn More<\/a>":[""],"The default HTML for the feed can be replaced with custom templates added to your theme's folder. Enable this setting to use these templates. See <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/guide-to-creating-custom-templates\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=custom-templates' target='_blank'>this guide<\/a>.":[""],"Setup":[""],"Let us setup your plugin!":[""],"Bring the power of YouTube videos directly to your site! With an easy setup, you'll have your first feed ready to go in minutes.":[""],"Launch the Setup Wizard":[""],"Welcome Image":[""],"Step":[""],"Exit Setup":[""],"1":[""],"Set up YouTube plugin ":[""],"To be able to fetch your YouTube videos we need a YouTube API key or a connected YouTube account.":[""],"Skip this step":[""],"Add API Key":[""],"Create all feed types (playlist and live streams)":[""],"Display video statistics, comments, and more":[""],"Fetch complete video history":[""],"Learn how to get a YouTube API Key":[""],"OR":[""],"Connect a YouTube account":[""],"Display 20+ videos from any channel":[""],"Cannot fetch playlists, live streams etc.":[""],"Cannot display likes and comments":[""],"Cannot filter out private videos":[""],"Connect YouTube Account Manually":[""],"Cannot connect a YouTube account from the plugin? Generate an access token from our website in a click and paste it below.":[""],"Paste Access Token here":[""],"Access Token entered is not valid":[""],"Generate Access Token":[""],"Add an API Key for YouTube":[""],"For optimal performance, reliability, and to use all feed types and features you will want to enter an API key. It is free to create and only takes a few minutes.":[""],"API key entered is not valid":[""],"API Key added successfully!":[""],"Your access token is added and now you should be able to add any YouTube feeds. You can update and delete it from Settings.":[""],"Okay":[""],"2":[""],"Configure features":[""],"YouTube channel feeds":[""],"Create and edit YouTube feeds":[""],"Downtime Prevention":[""],"Automatically prevents any downtime by cleverly using cache storage":[""],"Video player":[""],"Social Feed Collection":[""],"Install Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok plugins":[""],"Installs Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok feeds plugins":[""],"Install Reviews Feed and display customer reviews and an overall rating from Google or Yelp.":[""],"Installs Reviews Feed Plugin":[""],"Installs WPChat Plugin":[""],"Pro Features":[""],"Display playlists, live streams and comments":[""],"Show custom playlists, your live streams and video comments":[""],"Show custom end of video action":[""],"Display a customised call to action when a video ends":[""],"Convert Videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Copy all of your videos into WordPress custom posts":[""],"You might also be interested in...":[""],"Enable your favorite features and disable the ones you don\u2019t need":[""],"Install Selected Plugins":[""],"Activate a GDPR plugin":[""],"Install a GDPR plugin":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by activating a plugin today.":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by installing a plugin today.":[""],"Activate Selected Plugin":[""],"Install Selected Plugin":[""],"WPConsent activated":[""],"WPConsent installed":[""],"Why should I install a GDPR plugin?":[""],"Legal Compliance":[""],"Ensure your website complies with GDPR and other privacy regulations.":[""],"Build Trust":[""],"Show visitors you respect their privacy with transparent cookie consent.":[""],"Easy Management":[""],"Simplify cookie consent and privacy compliance with automated tools.":[""],"Upgrade to Unlock playlists, livestreams, custom actions and much more":[""],"To unlock these features and much more, upgrade to Pro and enter your license key below.":[""],"Upgrade to YouTube Feed Pro":[""],"Upgrade today and ":[""],"(auto-applied at checkout)":[""],"Awesome. You are all set up!":[""],"Here\u2019s an overview of everything that is setup":[""],"Complete Setup Without Upgrading":[""],"Installing":[""],"We\u2019re more than just an Youtube plugin!":[""],"Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":[""]}}}